OL,3,GNEWSAFlammable cladding to be removed
OL,4,Afrom blocks
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlammable cladding installed on two
OL,7,FSlough apartment buildings can be
OL,8,Fremoved after plans were approved.
OL,10,FLexington Apartments and Rivington
OL,11,FApartments, in Railway Terrace, are
OL,12,Fconsidered "higher risk" because of
OL,13,Ftheir size and height.
OL,15,FSlough Borough Council approved the
OL,16,Fplans but said that works should not
OL,17,Faffect their external appearance.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
