OL,3,GNEWSAFlammable cladding to be removed
OL,4,Afrom blocks
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Riverside Group, which is
OL,7,Fresponsible for managing the blocks,
OL,8,Fwants to replace the cladding,
OL,9,Finsulation and any connected parts of
OL,10,Fthe buildings' exterior.
